sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U1 as User 1 Request
    participant App as API Server (Concurrent Threads)
    participant DB as Inventory Database (stock = 1)
    participant U2 as User 2 Request

    Note over DB: Current State: product_id=99, stock=1
    U1->>App: Buy Product 99 (Thread 1)
    U2->>App: Buy Product 99 (Thread 2)

    App->>DB: Thread 1: SELECT stock FROM products WHERE id=99 (Returns 1)
    App->>DB: Thread 2: SELECT stock FROM products WHERE id=99 (Returns 1)

    Note over App: Both threads check: stock (1) > 0 -> TRUE!
    
    App->>DB: Thread 1: UPDATE products SET stock = 1 - 1 WHERE id=99 (stock becomes 0)
    App->>DB: Thread 2: UPDATE products SET stock = 1 - 1 WHERE id=99 (stock becomes 0 or overwrites!)
    
    App-->>U1: 200 OK: Purchase Successful!
    App-->>U2: 200 OK: Purchase Successful! (OVERSELLING BUG!)
